{
    "nodes":  [
                  {
                      "id":  "n1",
                      "type":  "text",
                      "text":  "# 2026-05-25 - 华为韬τ定律-半导体系统创新路径\n\n资料脑图｜按原文结构生成",
                      "x":  0,
                      "y":  0,
                      "width":  420,
                      "height":  170,
                      "color":  "1",
                      "styleAttributes":  {
                                              "shape":  "rounded-rectangle"
                                          }
                  },
                  {
                      "id":  "n2",
                      "type":  "text",
                      "text":  "## 来源信息\n- 来源平台 / 小红书\n- 来源日期 / 2026-05-25",
                      "x":  0,
                      "y":  -460,
                      "width":  430,
                      "height":  170,
                      "color":  "2",
                      "styleAttributes":  {
                                              "shape":  "rounded-rectangle"
                                          }
                  },
                  {
                      "id":  "n3",
                      "type":  "text",
                      "text":  "原始标题 / 华为“韬τ定律”｜半导体新路径看懂了吗",
                      "x":  -79,
                      "y":  -665,
                      "width":  330,
                      "height":  110,
                      "color":  "2",
                      "styleAttributes":  {
                                              "shape":  "rounded-rectangle"
                                          }
                  },
                  {
                      "id":  "n4",
                      "type":  "text",
                      "text":  "原始摘要 / 华为在 ISCAS 上提出“韬τ定律”；资料称半导体发展不再只依赖几何缩微，而转向系统创新",
                      "x":  79,
                      "y":  -665,
                      "width":  330,
                      "height":  110,
                      "color":  "2",
                      "styleAttributes":  {
                                              "shape":  "rounded-rectangle"
                                          }
                  },
                  {
                      "id":  "n5",
                      "type":  "text",
                      "text":  "## 候选主题\n- 半导体系统创新路径\n- 时间缩微 / 几何缩微放缓后的性能提升路线",
                      "x":  563,
                      "y":  -287,
                      "width":  430,
                      "height":  170,
                      "color":  "3",
                      "styleAttributes":  {
                                              "shape":  "rounded-rectangle"
                                          }
                  },
                  {
                      "id":  "n6",
                      "type":  "text",
                      "text":  "逻辑折叠",
                      "x":  789,
                      "y":  -451,
                      "width":  330,
                      "height":  110,
                      "color":  "3",
                      "styleAttributes":  {
                                              "shape":  "rounded-rectangle"
                                          }
                  },
                  {
                      "id":  "n7",
                      "type":  "text",
                      "text":  "器件、电路、芯片、系统多层级协同",
                      "x":  887,
                      "y":  -379,
                      "width":  330,
                      "height":  110,
                      "color":  "3",
                      "styleAttributes":  {
                                              "shape":  "rounded-rectangle"
                                          }
                  },
                  {
                      "id":  "n8",
                      "type":  "text",
                      "text":  "## 待核验问题\n- 除华为官网新闻外，是否有 ISCAS 会议论文、ChinaXiv 预印本或演讲全文可交叉核验？\n- “系统创新”与先进封装、Chiplet、3D 堆叠的关系是否由华为原文明确提出，还是二级解读扩展？",
                      "x":  702,
                      "y":  102,
                      "width":  430,
                      "height":  170,
                      "color":  "4",
                      "styleAttributes":  {
                                              "shape":  "rounded-rectangle"
                                          }
                  },
                  {
                      "id":  "n9",
                      "type":  "text",
                      "text":  "该线索与先进封装、Chiplet、3D 堆叠或国产半导体供应链是否有可验证关联？",
                      "x":  1062,
                      "y":  103,
                      "width":  330,
                      "height":  110,
                      "color":  "4",
                      "styleAttributes":  {
                                              "shape":  "rounded-rectangle"
                                          }
                  },
                  {
                      "id":  "n10",
                      "type":  "text",
                      "text":  "小红书原图与华为官网图的内容差异是否会影响对“韬τ定律”的理解？",
                      "x":  1027,
                      "y":  192,
                      "width":  330,
                      "height":  110,
                      "color":  "4",
                      "styleAttributes":  {
                                              "shape":  "rounded-rectangle"
                                          }
                  },
                  {
                      "id":  "n11",
                      "type":  "text",
                      "text":  "## 附图\n- !90-assets-附件/Cubox/2026-05-25-小红书-华为韬tau定律-原图.jpg\n- 图片来源：小红书原文页面。",
                      "x":  312,
                      "y":  414,
                      "width":  430,
                      "height":  170,
                      "color":  "5",
                      "styleAttributes":  {
                                              "shape":  "rounded-rectangle"
                                          }
                  },
                  {
                      "id":  "n12",
                      "type":  "text",
                      "text":  "!90-assets-附件/Cubox/2026-05-25-华为韬tau定律-ISCAS.jpg",
                      "x":  535,
                      "y":  579,
                      "width":  330,
                      "height":  110,
                      "color":  "5",
                      "styleAttributes":  {
                                              "shape":  "rounded-rectangle"
                                          }
                  },
                  {
                      "id":  "n13",
                      "type":  "text",
                      "text":  "## 已核验基础事实\n- 2026-05-25，华为官网发布新闻称：何庭波在 IEEE ISCAS 2026 上发表“半导体新路径探索与实践”主旨演…\n- 华为官网表述：韬(τ)定律以“时间(τ)缩微”替代“几何缩微”，并通过逻辑折叠等技术压缩信号传播时延、提升晶体管密度。",
                      "x":  -312,
                      "y":  414,
                      "width":  430,
                      "height":  170,
                      "color":  "6",
                      "styleAttributes":  {
                                              "shape":  "rounded-rectangle"
                                          }
                  },
                  {
                      "id":  "n14",
                      "type":  "text",
                      "text":  "华为官网列出四个协同层级：器件、电路、芯片、系统。",
                      "x":  -394,
                      "y":  619,
                      "width":  330,
                      "height":  110,
                      "color":  "6",
                      "styleAttributes":  {
                                              "shape":  "rounded-rectangle"
                                          }
                  },
                  {
                      "id":  "n15",
                      "type":  "text",
                      "text":  "## 图片内容整理\n- 突破传统平面布局边界。\n- 缩短关键路径走线。",
                      "x":  -702,
                      "y":  102,
                      "width":  430,
                      "height":  170,
                      "color":  "7",
                      "styleAttributes":  {
                                              "shape":  "rounded-rectangle"
                                          }
                  },
                  {
                      "id":  "n16",
                      "type":  "text",
                      "text":  "降低信号传播的电阻和电容负载，压缩时间常数 τ。",
                      "x":  -1027,
                      "y":  192,
                      "width":  330,
                      "height":  110,
                      "color":  "7",
                      "styleAttributes":  {
                                              "shape":  "rounded-rectangle"
                                          }
                  },
                  {
                      "id":  "n17",
                      "type":  "text",
                      "text":  "结合 3D 封装、Chiplet 等技术，提升单位面积晶体管密度。",
                      "x":  -1062,
                      "y":  103,
                      "width":  330,
                      "height":  110,
                      "color":  "7",
                      "styleAttributes":  {
                                              "shape":  "rounded-rectangle"
                                          }
                  },
                  {
                      "id":  "n18",
                      "type":  "text",
                      "text":  "## 图中产业机会清单\n- 逻辑板块 / 图中逻辑 / 图中列出的公司\n- 先进封装 / 3D IC / Chiplet / 逻辑折叠和 3D 堆叠的核心载体，突破制程限制，提升性能密度 / \u003cspan…",
                      "x":  -563,
                      "y":  -287,
                      "width":  430,
                      "height":  170,
                      "color":  "2",
                      "styleAttributes":  {
                                              "shape":  "rounded-rectangle"
                                          }
                  },
                  {
                      "id":  "n19",
                      "type":  "text",
                      "text":  "EDA / IP 设计工具链 / 支撑多层次协同设计、3D 布局、异构集成、时序/功耗仿真等需求 / \u003cspan style=…",
                      "x":  -887,
                      "y":  -379,
                      "width":  330,
                      "height":  110,
                      "color":  "2",
                      "styleAttributes":  {
                                              "shape":  "rounded-rectangle"
                                          }
                  },
                  {
                      "id":  "n20",
                      "type":  "text",
                      "text":  "半导体设备 / 刻蚀、薄膜、清洗、键合、量测等设备需求提升 / \u003cspan style=\"color:#d6a100\"\u003e北方华…",
                      "x":  -789,
                      "y":  -451,
                      "width":  330,
                      "height":  110,
                      "color":  "2",
                      "styleAttributes":  {
                                              "shape":  "rounded-rectangle"
                                          }
                  },
                  {
                      "id":  "n21",
                      "type":  "text",
                      "text":  "2026-05-28 抖音补充：产业影响推演\\n设备、材料、EDA/IP、国产算力均为低置信映射",
                      "x":  -40,
                      "y":  760,
                      "width":  430,
                      "height":  150,
                      "color":  "4",
                      "styleAttributes":  {
                                              "shape":  "rounded-rectangle"
                                          }
                  }
              ],
